  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;	To learn the benefits of sustainable livelihoods from partners implementing the Livelihoods Programme Zimbabwe (LPZ)
&quot;	To identify challenges and lessons learned from partner organisations implementing  the LPZ in order to take account of these aspects in planning a similar approach for Mongu Diocese 
